1
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:19,180
Congratulations,

2
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,910
Rin.

3
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:32,850
Actually...

4
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:39,730
I lied.

5
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:46,350
To tell you the truth...

6
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:51,680
I was scared.

7
00:00:59,060 --> 00:01:02,170
I didn't know if I'd be

8
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:06,500
happy for you.

9
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:11,430
For you, and your child.

10
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:23,220
Every time you spoke about your baby,

11
00:01:25,310 --> 00:01:28,080
you were clearly so happy.

12
00:01:29,540 --> 00:01:32,900
And I knew I had to be happy for you, too.

13
00:01:35,730 --> 00:01:38,140
But...

14
00:01:43,610 --> 00:01:46,320
Some part of me

15
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:49,570
deep, deep inside my heart,

16
00:01:49,570 --> 00:01:52,570
wanted to feel jealous.

17
00:02:00,010 --> 00:02:04,800
I'm so sorry.

18
00:02:09,130 --> 00:02:10,780
And yet.

19
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:14,030
Now that your baby is born,

20
00:02:15,570 --> 00:02:21,640
and I see you'll become a mother,

21
00:02:24,910 --> 00:02:27,980
I feel so relieved.

22
00:02:27,980 --> 00:02:30,770
I feel so, so overjoyed.

23
00:02:35,370 --> 00:02:37,800
I'm telling the truth.

24
00:02:39,170 --> 00:02:41,140
I really am.

25
00:02:45,740 --> 00:02:47,640
I think...

26
00:02:49,820 --> 00:02:52,680
My body's circumstances

27
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:56,790
will always,

28
00:02:56,790 --> 00:03:01,400
always bother me.

29
00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:09,620
But...

30
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:14,060
I've decided not to let it shackle me.

31
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:18,560
Though it may take time,

32
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,800
I want to embrace the future.

33
00:03:24,790 --> 00:03:29,570
Because you also made your dreams come true.

34
00:03:34,050 --> 00:03:35,970
Thank you, Rin.

35
00:03:44,870 --> 00:03:48,890
I have to go now.

36
00:03:51,110 --> 00:03:53,590
I have someone I need to talk to.

37
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:04,190
Sui?

38
00:04:06,460 --> 00:04:10,450
I need to ask you a question.

39
00:04:12,540 --> 00:04:15,800
We have nothing to talk about.

40
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:22,090
I can't ever forgive you.

41
00:04:26,850 --> 00:04:28,940
But my sister.

42
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:33,330
You found her when she had collapsed.

43
00:04:33,330 --> 00:04:36,080
Didn't you?

44
00:04:36,790 --> 00:04:40,540
A shame she had a successful delivery.

45
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:43,400
Thank you.

46
00:04:44,180 --> 00:04:45,790
What?

47
00:04:49,540 --> 00:04:53,380
I heard you helped her.

48
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:56,640
Now why would I do that?

49
00:04:58,290 --> 00:05:00,910
My sister's husband told me
you had passed by.

50
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:18,540
Ugh...

51
00:05:21,290 --> 00:05:24,540
Come on, get a grip.

52
00:05:27,810 --> 00:05:29,750
I can't forgive you

53
00:05:29,750 --> 00:05:32,880
for the harm you've done.

54
00:05:34,550 --> 00:05:38,170
I most likely won't ever forgive you.

55
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:45,910
But I'm truly thankful you saved my sister,

56
00:05:45,910 --> 00:05:48,370
and her baby.

57
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:54,190
Really, thank you.

58
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:58,240
You got the wrong person.

59
00:06:00,830 --> 00:06:03,170
Takizawa.

60
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:08,580
You have hurt me, time and time again.

61
00:06:11,930 --> 00:06:14,080
You have caused me great strife.

62
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:18,980
Even so, I can't change the fact

63
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:20,880
that I am infertile.

64
00:06:23,660 --> 00:06:26,760
And though I try to accept this fact,

65
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:33,640
I can't help but feel like
I'm misfortunate at times.

66
00:06:37,340 --> 00:06:39,020
Even so,

67
00:06:39,850 --> 00:06:43,460
I want to become happy,

68
00:06:43,460 --> 00:06:46,200
regardless of whether or not I can conceive.

69
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:50,780
Though I might not succeed immediately,

70
00:06:52,070 --> 00:06:54,780
I want to learn to enjoy my life.

71
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:01,530
Takizawa.

72
00:07:02,580 --> 00:07:04,870
Don't you also want to change?

73
00:07:07,250 --> 00:07:09,660
It doesn't matter who you are.

74
00:07:09,660 --> 00:07:12,590
Everyone has a shot at changing their future.

75
00:08:17,340 --> 00:08:19,630
[Name: You]

76
00:08:21,650 --> 00:08:23,610
What a pile.

77
00:08:23,610 --> 00:08:26,070
Like you're one to talk.

78
00:08:26,070 --> 00:08:27,380
That mountain of gifts

79
00:08:27,380 --> 00:08:30,300
is all from you, isn't it?

80
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:31,680
You doting aunt.

81
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:34,780
Hey, it's not that bad.

82
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:37,200
Thanks for the presents, you two.

83
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,640
I won't have to go shopping for a while.

84
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:41,610
Glad we could help.

85
00:08:42,580 --> 00:08:44,910
Sorry she chose to clonk out

86
00:08:44,910 --> 00:08:46,920
at a really inopportune time.

87
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:50,410
Don't worry about it.
We're having fun just looking.

88
00:08:50,410 --> 00:08:52,870
If anything, she's giving you a nice break.

89
00:08:52,870 --> 00:08:55,320
- How filial of her.
- Yeah.

90
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:57,750
She's been such a good girl.

91
00:08:59,610 --> 00:09:01,260
Something up?

92
00:09:02,030 --> 00:09:04,940
Nothing, really.

93
00:09:04,940 --> 00:09:07,420
I was just thinking back
to the day You was born.

94
00:09:10,340 --> 00:09:14,920
Don't feel like you have to answer today.

95
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:23,830
Your offer is too generous.

96
00:09:23,830 --> 00:09:25,880
I am happy you choose me.

97
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:28,130
Thank you.

98
00:09:28,730 --> 00:09:30,640
Not at all.

99
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:33,860
If anything, I ought to be thanking you.

100
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:40,290
I respect you greatly, Sui.

101
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:45,510
As do I, Hirose.

102
00:09:45,510 --> 00:09:48,350
I am truly grateful
for all you've given me.

103
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:51,910
And yet...

104
00:09:56,040 --> 00:10:01,910
I don't think I am your ideal match.

105
00:10:05,990 --> 00:10:08,890
I had earnestly considered

106
00:10:08,890 --> 00:10:13,550
a future with you.

107
00:10:14,280 --> 00:10:18,000
I'm certain it would be a happy one.

108
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:22,210
But I also felt as though

109
00:10:22,210 --> 00:10:26,020
I would be taking advantage of you.

110
00:10:27,670 --> 00:10:29,910
I had so readily assumed

111
00:10:29,910 --> 00:10:33,700
no one would accept my body as is.

112
00:10:35,300 --> 00:10:37,140
Which is why...

113
00:10:38,450 --> 00:10:42,750
I had presumed on your kind heart.

114
00:10:45,670 --> 00:10:51,190
You truly are an honest individual.

115
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:56,460
I am satisfied enough knowing if,

116
00:10:56,460 --> 00:11:00,120
even for a moment, you chose to look my way.

117
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:03,210
Thank you.

118
00:11:04,910 --> 00:11:07,280
No, thank you.

119
00:11:18,420 --> 00:11:21,690
I must be slightly drunk.

120
00:11:21,690 --> 00:11:24,170
Pardon?

121
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:28,580
You already have someone else in mind, no?

122
00:11:32,550 --> 00:11:35,460
You'll do just fine, Monou.

123
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:38,180
After all, you're the woman I fell for.

124
00:11:39,850 --> 00:11:43,520
Now, go on to them.

125
00:11:45,820 --> 00:11:48,350
Hirose...

126
00:11:48,350 --> 00:11:50,680
Thank you.

127
00:11:57,510 --> 00:11:58,810
[LIBRARY]

128
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:09,360
Heading home? How about we...

129
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:11,790
Wait, I thought you just took the exam.

130
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:15,840
I probably failed,
so I'm studying for next year.

131
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:17,150
You're a hard worker.

132
00:12:17,150 --> 00:12:19,020
I'm really not.

133
00:12:19,020 --> 00:12:22,870
I just needed something else to focus on.

134
00:12:22,870 --> 00:12:24,320
Huh?

135
00:12:24,970 --> 00:12:28,490
It feels fulfilling to keep my mind busy.

136
00:12:28,490 --> 00:12:34,000
Maybe it's good that I'm cultivating
my own happy space.

137
00:12:36,510 --> 00:12:38,340
I see.

138
00:12:38,340 --> 00:12:40,620
Well, good luck with your studies.

139
00:12:40,620 --> 00:12:43,140
Thanks.

140
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:44,240
See you tomorrow.

141
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,910
See you.

142
00:12:48,580 --> 00:12:50,760
See you tomorrow.

143
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:52,390
How's the design coming along?

144
00:12:52,390 --> 00:12:56,210
I'm almost done, thanks to you all.

145
00:12:56,210 --> 00:12:58,580
I'm just finalizing some details.

146
00:12:58,580 --> 00:13:03,610
Your worksheets helped
with my studies, as well.

147
00:13:05,010 --> 00:13:07,810
I'm glad. Let's both give it our all, yeah?

148
00:13:07,810 --> 00:13:09,060
Of course.

149
00:13:09,060 --> 00:13:10,120
See you tomorrow.

150
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:11,670
- See you.
- Night.

151
00:13:11,670 --> 00:13:13,380
Take care.

152
00:13:24,270 --> 00:13:27,340
I wanted to give it my all, too.

153
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:32,940
But Nana doesn't need me around.

154
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:37,880
I thought you were more of a go-getter.

155
00:13:38,470 --> 00:13:41,660
I've got a delicate heart, okay?

156
00:13:45,940 --> 00:13:48,100
No, you're right.

157
00:13:48,100 --> 00:13:50,490
Nana. I was thinking of heading out, too.

158
00:13:50,490 --> 00:13:52,400
Sure. Let's go.

159
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:55,270
Take care, Mao.

160
00:13:57,630 --> 00:14:00,090
Huh? Monou?

161
00:14:00,950 --> 00:14:02,680
Good evening.

162
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:07,180
I thought you had the day off today.

163
00:14:07,180 --> 00:14:09,560
I did.

164
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:12,200
I just forgot something at the office.

165
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:14,230
Must've been something important.

166
00:14:15,130 --> 00:14:16,850
You could say that.

167
00:14:18,100 --> 00:14:20,310
Well, hope you find it.

168
00:14:20,310 --> 00:14:22,200
Shall we, Nana?

169
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:24,410
Right. Good night, Monou.

170
00:14:24,410 --> 00:14:26,670
See you both tomorrow.

171
00:14:33,020 --> 00:14:35,040
You forgot something?

172
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:39,150
I would've brought it over for you.

173
00:14:41,190 --> 00:14:42,960
No, I lied.

174
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,410
What?

175
00:14:48,100 --> 00:14:52,790
I love you, Mao.

176
00:14:55,700 --> 00:14:57,190
Huh?

177
00:14:58,780 --> 00:15:01,020
Sorry, that must've surprised you.

178
00:15:01,020 --> 00:15:04,850
I just...

179
00:15:04,850 --> 00:15:10,150
I really needed you to know, so...

180
00:15:11,790 --> 00:15:13,600
Here I am.

181
00:15:16,700 --> 00:15:18,550
<i>Mao.</i>

182
00:15:21,470 --> 00:15:25,230
I decided I'd change.

183
00:15:29,650 --> 00:15:31,220
Sorry.

184
00:15:31,220 --> 00:15:35,500
I didn't realize you'd be busy.

185
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:41,480
I just really wanted you
to hear how I felt.

186
00:15:42,550 --> 00:15:44,150
See you tomorrow.

187
00:16:04,420 --> 00:16:06,980
Why would you get the jump on me?

188
00:16:08,010 --> 00:16:09,450
Huh?

189
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:14,890
Come with me.

190
00:16:18,680 --> 00:16:21,090
I broke up with Mizuno.

191
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:29,080
So, I was trying to focus on work,
and not romance.

192
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:37,450
But I want to change, too.

193
00:16:38,730 --> 00:16:40,870
Mao?

194
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:47,440
I respect you, Sui.

195
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:50,850
I respect your efforts to try hard alone.

196
00:16:50,850 --> 00:16:53,140
And yet...

197
00:16:53,140 --> 00:16:56,880
I want to be someone you can rely on.

198
00:16:56,880 --> 00:16:59,510
To be your support, when you're tired.

199
00:17:01,410 --> 00:17:04,240
I want to hug you,
and tell you you're not alone.

200
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:08,920
I want to be the only one for you.

201
00:17:15,360 --> 00:17:19,820
I love you, too.

202
00:17:27,750 --> 00:17:29,960
Mao.

203
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:35,200
There's something I haven't told you yet.

204
00:17:36,350 --> 00:17:37,860
What is it?

205
00:17:47,420 --> 00:17:50,280
I'm infertile.

206
00:17:51,870 --> 00:17:55,400
I want to stay with you, of course.

207
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:59,940
But if my infertility changes how you feel...

208
00:18:11,070 --> 00:18:13,190
I love you, Sui.

209
00:18:15,840 --> 00:18:19,850
Why would you push me away like that?

210
00:18:20,650 --> 00:18:23,460
Don't assume I'd leave you.

211
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:28,570
I don't want you to worry

212
00:18:28,570 --> 00:18:31,770
over nonexistent futures, alone.

213
00:18:37,660 --> 00:18:39,910
Sorry.

214
00:18:39,910 --> 00:18:42,770
I should have mentioned this earlier.

215
00:18:43,940 --> 00:18:45,730
Sui.

216
00:18:46,670 --> 00:18:51,370
I knew about your body,
before I fell for you.

217
00:18:52,810 --> 00:18:54,260
You did?

218
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:58,260
I overheard someone mention it.

219
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:04,550
But that never bothered me.
I love you, for who you are.

220
00:19:06,750 --> 00:19:08,300
Mao...

221
00:19:10,040 --> 00:19:13,140
You never know how you'll feel in the future.

222
00:19:14,100 --> 00:19:17,560
People change.

223
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:22,680
That goes for the both of us, right?

224
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:26,480
I'm just as anxious, you know.

225
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:27,990
You are?

226
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:35,930
How about this?

227
00:19:35,930 --> 00:19:40,230
I decide my own happiness.

228
00:19:40,230 --> 00:19:44,100
And you decide yours.

229
00:19:45,740 --> 00:19:49,700
It's my choice?

230
00:19:50,540 --> 00:19:53,390
Then we can think about our future, together.

231
00:19:54,290 --> 00:19:56,400
I don't mind if we argue about it.

232
00:19:57,790 --> 00:20:02,840
So long as we agree on the outcome.

233
00:20:06,230 --> 00:20:10,720
Let's share both the good

234
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:12,730
and the bad with each other.

235
00:20:14,100 --> 00:20:15,580
Yeah.

236
00:20:20,540 --> 00:20:23,440
<i>I want to consider a future with you.</i>

237
00:20:24,230 --> 00:20:28,270
<i>Because I want us to be happy, together.</i>

238
00:20:30,510 --> 00:20:33,400
[3 Years Later]
[Idea Construction Office]

239
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:37,170
A dating app?

240
00:20:37,970 --> 00:20:39,480
Can you blame a guy?

241
00:20:39,480 --> 00:20:41,600
Waiting for a girl isn't getting me anywhere.

242
00:20:41,600 --> 00:20:44,780
What if you get a successful match?

243
00:20:44,780 --> 00:20:47,840
Then I'd take the girl out to dinner.

244
00:20:47,840 --> 00:20:49,460
She'll get a free meal.

245
00:20:49,460 --> 00:20:54,790
It's what a guy's gotta do
to get dinner with a girl.

246
00:20:54,790 --> 00:20:59,250
Let me have my fun, okay?

247
00:20:59,990 --> 00:21:03,130
You should just treat me to dinner instead.

248
00:21:05,150 --> 00:21:06,230
Huh?

249
00:21:06,230 --> 00:21:10,290
We could celebrate the fact
I'm a licensed architect now.

250
00:21:10,290 --> 00:21:11,860
Or not, if you don't want to.

251
00:21:11,860 --> 00:21:16,080
No, let's do this. Let's go.

252
00:21:16,080 --> 00:21:17,180
Dinner?

253
00:21:17,180 --> 00:21:19,440
Let me tag along.

254
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:22,760
- No!
- No!

255
00:21:22,760 --> 00:21:24,280
What?

256
00:21:26,230 --> 00:21:28,770
Look at me.

257
00:21:28,770 --> 00:21:31,010
Daddy's taking a picture.

258
00:21:31,010 --> 00:21:33,300
Say cheese!

259
00:21:33,300 --> 00:21:34,370
Got it.

260
00:21:34,370 --> 00:21:35,930
How do we look?

261
00:21:35,930 --> 00:21:37,510
Let me see.

262
00:21:37,510 --> 00:21:39,800
Nice picture!

263
00:21:39,800 --> 00:21:43,330
Misaki, you've changed.

264
00:21:43,330 --> 00:21:45,300
Really?

265
00:21:45,300 --> 00:21:48,530
I think you're imagining things.

266
00:21:50,600 --> 00:21:52,850
Hurry up. We still have stores to hit.

267
00:21:52,850 --> 00:21:54,120
Wait up!

268
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:56,670
Jeez, buy a car already.

269
00:21:56,670 --> 00:21:59,060
With my salary? Not happening.

270
00:21:59,060 --> 00:22:01,250
Then get your daddy to retire already.

271
00:22:01,250 --> 00:22:02,820
Not happening either!

272
00:22:02,820 --> 00:22:05,580
Hey, wait!

273
00:22:11,470 --> 00:22:12,890
Give this a once over.

274
00:22:12,890 --> 00:22:15,580
Yes, sir.

275
00:22:22,710 --> 00:22:26,390
Come over for dinner next Saturday.

276
00:22:26,390 --> 00:22:30,090
My relatives sent too many vegetables, again.

277
00:22:40,760 --> 00:22:43,020
Still working?

278
00:22:46,180 --> 00:22:48,850
I didn't realize what time it was.

279
00:22:48,850 --> 00:22:51,550
I'll wait until you're at
a good stopping point.

280
00:22:57,460 --> 00:23:00,440
Matsubara brought us souvenirs.

281
00:23:00,440 --> 00:23:04,150
He wished you luck on the contest.

282
00:23:05,100 --> 00:23:08,040
He's a considerate guy, isn't he?

